    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Austin",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110877859052364837595/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUgBZjwt3WTYewUyOabSJi8oLTuUWRR6FMMQqgEXhuc8iKtV4bv=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 months ago",
        "text": "I ran over a nail on a Sunday and my tire pressure was decreasing extremely rapidly. I thought I was screwed, because every other mechanic shop in the area are closed on Sundays.\n\nLuckily, this mechanic shop was open!! I pulled up and he patched up my tire in record speed at a very fair price. Mind you, I totally thought I needed a tire replacement because the nail was in deep and sideways, but he worked his magic and thanks to him, I’m not broke over a tire replacement.\n\nAlso, prior to opening his shop, he was actually a mechanic working at a Tesla dealership! He knows the ins and outs of Tesla vehicles and he was also wearing his Tesla pants. If I have any mechanical problems with my Tesla in the future, I will definitely be going to him:)",
        "time": 1757270608,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Andrew Laramee",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115664713202649926445/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWadnzzuoQYh2ksS1dmWRB94mmAmX03GqZV7lF3nHg7nY3qcDv5=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "Excellent service and I was able to get an appointment on the same day for an oil change and potential oil leak inspection. It wasn't clear why the oil was burning so fast so the mechanic came to with a plan to check on it monthly so he could diagnose the problem. They also have an aquarium in the waiting room which helped my kids stay cool while we waited. It was a wonderful first visit and I'll be returning in the future.",
        "time": 1766343655,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Jessica Sterner",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111601018750857032845/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUpKFyLiPrJDFT_uMdk15wJDF-RGRroNMD2NCaoD6Q_ahwzlaln=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 weeks ago",
        "text": "I needed and emergency appointment New Years Eve to change my battery, they were able to squeeze me in.  Not only were they polite, trustworthy and reliable, the prices were amazing. I am looking for a long term relationship with a mechanic and I think I found my people. Thank you",
        "time": 1769379205,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "C W",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107753104234670122717/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ9uLkhWLvGFnmh9lXDes97K-4Xdkl-rkO4mb0Q8EiTPGFaaw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "My experience was very positive. Had a bad situation where I got a damaged tire from road debris off the highway. They were friendly, polite, helpful, prompt, good communication, and reasonably priced. I recommend.",
        "time": 1767290691,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Satish Maddula",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107129034081268276108/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWcYe1noBeXVOFK36_U-3XjIAKme8gbM8aqzAk7tVqRPD817geQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "Its hard get appointment on the same day in December. Service Auto replaced valves for two tires for my van, owner was able to squeeze me in on the same day. He is courteous, honest person. Prices are reasonable. I highly recommend.",
        "time": 1764361894,
        "translated": false
      }
